rogramme-to-help-children-manage-stress-and-understand-emotions-23-years-later-mindup-reports-reaching-more-than-7-million-children-across-48-countries-through-brain-based-lessons/articleshow/135601345.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2003-goldie-hawn-started-a-programme-to-help-children-manage-stress-and-understand-emotions-23-years-later-mindup-reports-reaching-more-than-7-million-children-across-48-countries-through-brain-based-lessons/articleshow/135601345.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T05:49:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135601700,imgsize-2129680.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scientists find first Martian garnet in meteorite, but its origin remains unclear]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135454065.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/space/scientists-identify-a-completely-new-type-of-rock-in-a-martian-meteorite-and-find-garnet-on-mars-for-the-first-time-but-its-planetary-origin-remains-unconfirmed/articleshow/135454065.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/space/scientists-identify-a-completely-new-type-of-rock-in-a-martian-meteorite-and-find-garnet-on-mars-for-the-first-time-but-its-planetary-origin-remains-unconfirmed/articleshow/135454065.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T05:58:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135454159,imgsize-603793.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Australia releases 6 captive-bred broad-headed snakes in world first]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135562371.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/australia-releases-6-captive-bred-broad-headed-snakes-into-the-wild-in-a-world-first-after-building-a-breeding-population-from-just-17-wild-sourced-adults/articleshow/135562371.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/australia-releases-6-captive-bred-broad-headed-snakes-into-the-wild-in-a-world-first-after-building-a-breeding-population-from-just-17-wild-sourced-adults/articleshow/135562371.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T06:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135562528,imgsize-2494933.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Child with cancer' stopped trick-or-treaters: What neighbourhood children did next left a mother overwhelmed]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135636760.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Zoe, a brave three-year-old girl, had to miss Halloween in 2020 due to her fight against cancer. To ensure she felt the spirit of the holiday, children from her neighborhood generously laid out candy on her doorstep. Their thoughtful gesture encapsulated the warmth of community, showing how acts of kindness can truly embody the spirit of togetherness during challenging times.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/child-with-cancer-stopped-trick-or-treaters-what-neighbourhood-children-did-next-left-a-mother-overwhelmed/articleshow/135636760.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/child-with-cancer-stopped-trick-or-treaters-what-neighbourhood-children-did-next-left-a-mother-overwhelmed/articleshow/135636760.cms]]></guid><pubDate>20