al for fostering enduring change.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/emma-watson-donated-1-million-to-a-uk-fund-fighting-sexual-harassment-its-impact-report-later-recorded-46100-women-and-girls-reached-over-20000-professionals-trained-and-59-grants-awarded/articleshow/135578193.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/emma-watson-donated-1-million-to-a-uk-fund-fighting-sexual-harassment-its-impact-report-later-recorded-46100-women-and-girls-reached-over-20000-professionals-trained-and-59-grants-awarded/articleshow/135578193.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T03:52:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135578287,imgsize-1301026.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A 1953 Leonora Carrington painting bought from a Mexico City gallery the year it was made has stayed with one family for more than 70 years; now authenticated, Fil d’Or goes up for auction on November 10]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135636224.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Fil d'Or is a unique artwork by Leonora Carrington with a fascinating backstory. It was purchased way back in 1953 and remained treasured by a single family for many years. This painting showcases a cool technique known as grattage, which is part of the Surrealist movement and provides insight into Carrington's distinctive and imaginative style. Now authenticated, Fil d’Or goes up for auction on November 10]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-1953-leonora-carrington-painting-bought-from-a-mexico-city-gallery-the-year-it-was-made-has-stayed-with-one-family-for-more-than-70-years-now-authenticated-fil-dor-goes-up-for-auction-on-november-10/articleshow/135636224.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA